# 031 · The design reasons, in public docs

**Status:** `PROPOSED` · **Version:** [v0.3.0](../roadmap.md#v030)

## What

Move the design reasons from the maintainers' private v1 plan into the public docs where they are not there already: trust boundaries, data, the key flows, the objective contract, judging defaults, scheduling, deployment and observability.

## Why

Contributors need the reasons behind the design. After this goal, the private plan can retire completely.

## Done when

- [ ] Every section of the private v1 plan is in `docs/`, replaced by a goal, or recorded as dropped.

## Decisions

None yet.

